               "Implementing redundancy or fail-safe modes to handle detected faults without compromising vehicle operation."
            ]
         }
      },
      {  
         "ID": 46,
         "text": "The power steering system must provide consistent torque feedback to the driver that corresponds to the actual steering conditions.",
         "analysis": {
            "implications": [
