               "Enhances overall vehicle safety by ensuring that drivers are informed about potential control system failures."
            ],
            "challenges": [
               "Developing reliable criteria for detecting malfunctions or performance deviations in real-time.",
               "Designing intuitive alert mechanisms that effectively communicate the urgency and nature of detected issues to the driver."
            ]
